      "source": "https://www.nps.gov/bicy/learn/historyculture/ochopee.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ochopee began as a one‑family tomato‑farming community in the early 1920s, growing around James Gaunt’s 240‑acre farm.",
